@startuml SolutionArchitectureSequenceDiagram
title Prototype Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Developer

participant "Command Line" as CLI
participant "Configuration Loader" as ConfigurationLoader
participant "Composition Root" as CompositionRoot
participant "AnalysisService" as AnalysisService
participant "Project Inspector" as ProjectInspector
participant "Detector Registry" as DetectorRegistry
participant "External Detector Adapter\nDirty-Waters" as DirtyWatersAdapter
participant "Custom Smell Detector" as CustomDetector
participant "Package Governance Detector" as GovernanceDetector
participant "PeerSpin Detector" as PeerSpinDetector
participant "Source-Usage Detector\nKnip" as SourceUsageDetector
participant "Vulnerability Analyzer\nnpm audit + GHSA metadata" as VulnerabilityAnalyzer
participant "Responsiveness Analyzer\nnpm + GitHub activity" as ResponsivenessAnalyzer
participant "Score Engine\nSSSS" as ScoreEngine
participant "Report Generator" as ReportGenerator
participant "JSON Analysis Result" as JsonResult
participant "Markdown Report" as MarkdownReport

Developer -> CLI: run npm analysis command
activate CLI

CLI -> ConfigurationLoader: resolve configuration and credentials
activate ConfigurationLoader
ConfigurationLoader --> CLI: validated immutable configuration
deactivate ConfigurationLoader

CLI -> CompositionRoot: assemble configured pipeline
activate CompositionRoot
CompositionRoot --> CLI: AnalysisService
deactivate CompositionRoot

CLI -> AnalysisService: analyze repository and selected ref
activate AnalysisService

AnalysisService -> ProjectInspector: inspect repository
activate ProjectInspector
ProjectInspector --> AnalysisService: project, manifests and full graph
deactivate ProjectInspector

par Modular smell detection
  AnalysisService -> DetectorRegistry: detect(context)
  activate DetectorRegistry
  DetectorRegistry -> DirtyWatersAdapter: detect external smells
  DirtyWatersAdapter --> DetectorRegistry: findings
  DetectorRegistry -> CustomDetector: detect manifest and lockfile smells
  CustomDetector --> DetectorRegistry: findings
  DetectorRegistry -> GovernanceDetector: detect governance smells
  GovernanceDetector --> DetectorRegistry: findings
  DetectorRegistry -> PeerSpinDetector: detect peer-resolution loops
  PeerSpinDetector --> DetectorRegistry: findings
  DetectorRegistry -> SourceUsageDetector: detect unused and missing dependencies
  SourceUsageDetector --> DetectorRegistry: findings
  DetectorRegistry --> AnalysisService: aggregated findings, metadata and warnings
  deactivate DetectorRegistry
else Vulnerability evidence
  AnalysisService -> VulnerabilityAnalyzer: run npm audit and enrich advisory persistence
  activate VulnerabilityAnalyzer
  VulnerabilityAnalyzer --> AnalysisService: package-level V evidence and warnings
  deactivate VulnerabilityAnalyzer
end

AnalysisService -> AnalysisService: enrich detected findings with V evidence
AnalysisService -> ResponsivenessAnalyzer: calculate package-level R evidence
activate ResponsivenessAnalyzer
ResponsivenessAnalyzer --> AnalysisService: R evidence and warnings
deactivate ResponsivenessAnalyzer
AnalysisService -> AnalysisService: enrich findings with R evidence

AnalysisService -> ScoreEngine: score enriched findings using full graph
activate ScoreEngine
ScoreEngine --> AnalysisService: scored smells and severity ratings
deactivate ScoreEngine

AnalysisService -> ReportGenerator: generate outputs
activate ReportGenerator
ReportGenerator -> JsonResult: write analysis-results.json
ReportGenerator -> MarkdownReport: write analysis-report.md
ReportGenerator --> AnalysisService: output paths and JSON document
deactivate ReportGenerator

AnalysisService --> CLI: analysis summary and report paths
deactivate AnalysisService
CLI --> Developer: show generated output paths
deactivate CLI
@enduml